      "value": "@{667353ba8663454809d39116|full_name}\n\nwill likely need more testing but this is what ive noted so far.\n\nuncompressed size pending happpens with all avatars but the \"perf blocking\" only affects some but quite a lot are effected.\n\nthere was no apparent commonality between avatars. download sizes, perf rank and texture mem vary widely and avatars that i had seen on live/previous beta were perf blocked even after setting threshold to 500mb.\n\nthere upload dates dont seem to be related and nither does instance population.\n\nshould also be noted that \"uncompressed size pending\" does not occur on live and did not occur in the previous beta. \n\npersonaly i suspected mip streaming confusing the system but older avatars without it enabled would not be effected (unless its somehow forced on).",
