      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this is what you guys were asking for on the discord with the output log. I'm still having the issue of literally everyone now being a imposter or fallback avatar, including friends. I tried clearing cache, reinstalling, and switching from open beta to live, and nothing fixes the issue anymore. Of note, if I force show someones avatar it will work ok but even if they meet my avatar display settings it wont show the avatar unless its force shown.\n\nThe boxes to view avatar author and stats are also greyed out unless its force shown since its showing the imposter. Odd how switching to live doesn't fix it at all and reinstalling.\n\nEdit: Cleared cache again, uninstalled, then reinstalled directly as live and not open beta, then changed settings to dont block poorly optimized, max download 200Mb, and max uncompressed 500Mb and it seems to be working properly now. Can try going back into open beta to see if its still broken.",
